## WebAppAnalyzer fingerprint dataset

Name: WebAppAnalyzer
Source: https://github.com/enthec/webappanalyzer
Path: backend/data/vendor/webappanalyzer/
License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

The technology fingerprint dataset bundled in this repository
(backend/data/vendor/webappanalyzer/) is sourced from the WebAppAnalyzer
project maintained by enthec. It is used here to identify technologies
present on a target website during the detection phase of the analysis
pipeline.

This dataset is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. The
full license text is available at:

https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

The upstream license file can also be found at:

https://github.com/enthec/webappanalyzer/blob/main/LICENSE

No modifications have been made to the dataset files. The dataset is
vendored locally to support offline/containerized builds. To update the
dataset to the latest upstream version, run:

cd backend && npm run update:techdb

